    <tags>ajazz mirabox streamdeck keyboard mouse rgb hid foss admin</tags>
    <summary>Open, cross-platform control center for AJAZZ devices (Stream Docks, keyboards, mice).</summary>
    <description>
AJAZZ Control Center is a modern, open, cross-platform control center for AJAZZ
(and Mirabox-OEM) devices &#8212; Stream Dock macropads, mechanical keyboards and
gaming mice &#8212; with a Qt 6 / QML interface and a sandboxed, out-of-process
Python plugin system compatible with Stream Deck (`.sdPlugin`) plugins.

Features include per-key LCD configuration, RGB lighting, encoders/dials, macros,
profiles, host time-sync to firmware RTCs, and wireless battery readout.

This package installs the official signed-by-CI MSI published on the project's
GitHub Releases.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/Aiacos/ajazz-control-center/releases/tag/v0.1.1</releaseNotes>
